h2 ActiveX RDP

.form-line
    .header
        .title About
        .description.
            RDP desktops rendered by the system ActiveX control (mstscax.dll).
            The connection — TLS, CredSSP, the socket — is made end-to-end by
            the Microsoft-signed RDP stack; the plugin's native code never
            touches the network.

.form-line(*ngIf='diag?.status === "ok"')
    .header
        .title Native bridge
        .description Loaded and operational.

.form-line(*ngIf='diag && diag.status !== "ok"')
    .header
        .title Native bridge problem
        .description {{ diag.detail }}

.form-line(*ngIf='addonPath')
    .header
        .title Addon binary
        .description {{ addonPath }} — rebuild with `npm run build:native` in the plugin checkout.

.form-line
    .header
        .title Passwords
        .description.
            Enable Tabby's Vault (Settings › Vault) to keep RDP passwords
            encrypted; without it they are stored in plain text in config.yaml.

.form-line
    .header
        .title Keyboard
        .description.
            While the RDP desktop has focus, all keys go to the remote session
            and Tabby's own hotkeys do not fire. Bind and use "RDP: disconnect"
            / "RDP: reconnect" in Settings › Hotkeys — global shortcuts keep
            working regardless of focus.
